<title>USA: Pamida Holdings names new chief operating officer.</title>
<headline>Pamida Holdings names new chief operating officer.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pamida Holdings Corp said Tuesday it promoted Frank Washburn, an executive vice president, to the additional post of chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Washburn will be responsible for the day-to-day operations of Pamida Inc, including stores, information systems, logistics, real estate and store planning, the company said.</p>
<p>Pamida Holdings is a mass merchandise retailer operating 149 stores in 15 states.</p>
<p>Its shares closed unchanged Tuesday at 3-1/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
